# BuildKit reads this file (not a root .dockerignore) for
# containers/Dockerfile.gmd because it sits next to the Dockerfile and is named
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore. The build context is the repository root, so the
# file is an allowlist: everything is excluded except what the Dockerfile
# COPYs. GMD and GMD_SGT sources arrive through named contexts (build.sh).
*
!containers/scripts/validate_platform.py
!containers/scripts/validate_sgt_stack.py
!containers/scripts/build_gmd_probe_model.py
!containers/scripts/validate_gmd_stack.py
!containers/probes/gmd
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
